      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to see this. It's one of the few things I miss from Second Life, where emotes, toys, and other things weren't tied to only one avatar, but to your account as a whole, allowing you to use them on any avatar.\n\nCould potentially also reduce avatar sizes indirectly as well. Instead of hard baking some dances or whatnot into your avatar, you just \"add\" it to your inventory to use on all avatars, including ones you didn't upload.",
